      "sourceTextSha256": "ffa3460082dedbbd91ff51c278150f1b18e9df9623db8f2278c602b1fc654e12",
      "text": "Day 7 · After breakfast, half-day panoramic city tour of South America’s most European and cosmopolitan city. Drive along Avenida 9 de Julio, home to the famous Teatro Colón and the Obelisk, and visit Plaza de Mayo, surrounded by historic buildings such as the Casa Rosada, the Cathedral and the Town Hall, then Plaza San Martín, Avenida Alvear and Plaza del Congreso.\n\nThe tour continues along historic Avenida de Mayo and vibrant Avenida Corrientes, through the colourful neighbourhoods of La Boca and San Telmo, elegant Palermo and Recoleta, and modern Puerto Madero, a lively dining and entertainment area. Return to the hotel.",
